add table ip ferm
delete table ip ferm
add table ip ferm
add chain ip ferm INPUT { type filter hook input priority 0; }
add chain ip ferm raw_PREROUTING { type filter hook prerouting priority -300; }
add rule ip ferm INPUT ct helper "ftp" accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT numgen inc mod 4 0 accept
add rule ip ferm INPUT numgen inc mod 8 3 accept
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING notrack
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING ct event set new,related,destroy
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING ct zone set 5
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING ct original zone set 5
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING ct reply zone set 7
add rule ip ferm raw_PREROUTING notrack ct zone set 1 ct event set new,destroy
